      <img class="mx-auto w-36 h-36 object-cover rounded-full border-4 border-violet-300"
        src="/static/members/jahmere.jpeg" alt="Jahmere">

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        Hi there! I’m JahmereQ, a passionate front-end development Senior-student with a keen eye for design and a love
        for coding. My journey in web development began with a fascination for how beautiful and functional websites
        come to life. Now, I’m diving deep into the world of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and modern frameworks to build
        interactive and user-friendly web experiences.
      </p>

      <a href="https://github.com/JahmereStacks" target="_blank"
        class="block text-center font-semibold text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400 hover:underline">
        GitHub Profile
      </a>
